        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write about your habits using todos los días, cada semana, otro, el mismo, todo el…\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Say aloud what you do every day, every week and every year, and what you would like to change for something else."
